 { side: 'EAST', zones: 'B \u00b7 D \u00b7 F \u00b7 G', crews: 'United Services (50 MW)', scope: 83512, installed: 78, remaining: 83434, mw: 49.7, note: '<strong>80% of every module still to be installed on this project.</strong> United has placed 78 modules in total - the Aug 3 golden row - and needs 3,476/day to Sep 6 from a standing start. It cannot begin in Zone F until it closes tracker rows there, and it has closed none in ten working days.' }
